# API and Testing

- Mount new endpoints under `app/api/v1/endpoints/` and register in `app/api/v1/router.py`
- Use `Depends(get_db)` from `app.api.deps` for database sessions
- Override dependencies in tests via `app.dependency_overrides`
- Use `pytest-asyncio` with `httpx.AsyncClient` and `ASGITransport`
- One logical assertion focus per test; name tests `test_<behavior>`
